    "text": "<p>A huge circular arc of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ly</mi></math> subtends an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> at the centre of the circle. How long it would take for a body to complete <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> revolution if its speed is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>AU</mi></math> per second?<br />Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ly</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>AU</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
